<ArticleLayout
  title="Import a Workout PDF Into an App — Turn Your Coach's Plan Into a Trackable Program"
  description="Stop copying your coach's workout PDF by hand. BulkUp reads the PDF or a photo of your plan and turns it into a day-by-day program you can log set by set on iPhone and Apple Watch."
